OL,5,G1900 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FSergeant Mick and the Operational
OL,7,     FSupport Unit carry out a raid on a
OL,8,     Fhouse with suspected drug
OL,9,     Factivity.
OL,10,G2000 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,11,G     Speeders
OL,12,     FThe PCs tail an uninsured vehicle.
OL,13,     FWhen they finally catch up and
OL,14,     Fquestion the suspect, they
OL,15,     Fdiscover the driver has never
OL,16,     Ftaken a driving test.
OL,17,G2100 Police Interceptors
