OL,12,G0300 Trucking Hell
OL,13,     FJust outside Newcastle, Kev is
OL,14,     Fsent to rescue a wheelie bin
OL,15,     Fdelivery truck that has got stuck.
OL,16,     FWith torrential rain forecast,
OL,17,     Fthis job is turning into a
OL,18,     Frecovery nightmare.
